Package: minibioc
Title: Create a mini Bioconductor package repository
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Marcel", "Ramos", , "marcel.ramos@sph.cuny.edu", c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Replicate the Bioconductor package repository from source
    package directories. Create source and binary tarballs for a set of
    packages. Build the packages' HTML manual pages.
